  "name": "No Diet Club - Best food tour in Le Marais",
  "description": "Le NO DIET CLUB is a unique culinary discovery experience in many cities. Seven years after its launch, we've welcomed hundreds of thousands of participants and garnered over 15,000 5-star reviews. Our goal is simple: to introduce you to the best of local cuisine, far removed from the tourist clichés with smile! Quality/quantity food and fun only :)\n\nAt No Diet Club, we love melty cheese, bad jokes, and helping folks discover dishes locals love best. In this 3-hour walking tour, we'll show you around the Marais, stopping for Parisian classics, pastries, snacks, and more. We promise you'll eat well—every taste is included in the tour! So are fun facts, historical details, and restaurant tips.\n\n5 tastings minimum, skip your breakfast. Tastings may vary!",
